@rotate bone leg_fl by x func (sin(t * 6.2832) * 28)
@rotate bone leg_br by x func (sin(t * 6.2832) * 28)
@rotate bone leg_fr by x func (sin(t * 6.2832) * -28)
@rotate bone leg_bl by x func (sin(t * 6.2832) * -28)
@rotate bone head by x func (sin(t * 12.566) * 3)
@rotate bone tail by z func (sin(t * 6.2832) * 12)
